--- downloaded at build time, never redistributed by us ---

dl/ is gitignored and holds what `make` fetches: the limine bootloader
binaries, edk2 OVMF firmware, and the userland package sources the LFS ladder
compiles (lua, sqlite, m4, tar, ...). Each keeps its own upstream license.
`make distclean` removes them. No love artifact contains them.


